//    2026-09-07, one variable, the escape channel:
//      Box::new(|| -> i64 { x }) coerced to Box<dyn Fn() -> i64>  -> REFUSED
//         "coercion to `dyn Fn` requires `|| -> i64: 'static` ... (object lifetime bound)"
//      keep(|| -> &i64 { &x }) through a plain generic `keep<F>(f:F)->F` -> ADMITS
//    This port passes through NO channel at all, so nothing is checked.
